<title>PERU: Peru's Morococha Q3 net rises 15.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Peru's Morococha Q3 net rises 15.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share - N.A.</p>
<p>Net - 5.77 million soles vs 5.01 million soles</p>
<p>Revs - 76.43 million soles vs 76.14 million soles</p>
<p>NOTES: Compania Minera San Ignacio de Morococha SA is a polymetallic miner.</p>
<p>-- Renzo Pipoli, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134</p>
